    "commit_message": "* Dashboards: Show values preview for data source variables in the edit pane\n\nThe dynamic dashboards edit pane builds its variable options per type via\ngetOptions(). getDataSourceVariableOptions only registered Type and Name\nfilter, so data source variables had no \"Preview of values\" anywhere,\nwhile custom and query variables kept theirs through their modal editors.\n\nRegister a preview item that renders the shared VariableValuesPreview,\nfed by the same useGetAllVariableOptions helper the full page editor uses.\n\n* Update public/app/features/dashboard-scene/settings/variables/editors/DataSourceVariableEditor.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Marc M. <146180665+grafakus@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Marc M. <146180665+grafakus@users.noreply.github.com>",
